@startuml
' 图2-1 系统体系结构逻辑视图（当前实现）
' 依据：docs/api/openapi.yaml 与当前代码（backend/internal、frontend/src）
' 插入建议：横向整页或单独一页，保证图内字号缩放后不小于 7pt

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 14
skinparam ranksep 26
skinparam ArrowColor #46617A
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontColor #2F3E4E
skinparam componentBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EEF4FA
skinparam componentFontColor #10304C
skinparam packageBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam packageFontColor #1F4E79
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF7E0
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99A4A
skinparam noteFontSize 12

title 图2-1 系统体系结构逻辑视图（当前实现）

' ===== ① 客户端层 =====
package "① 客户端层（浏览器 · Vue 3 + TypeScript SPA，独立 Vite 工程）" as L1 {
  component "Dashboard.vue\n创建行程表单；idle / processing / ready / failed 三态渲染\nfailed 用 lastReady 保留已有内容" as Dashboard
  component "useJourneyStore（Pinia）\nsnapshot · lastReady · connected · fallbackActive\nload / stop / apply / pollState；断线 20s 后每 15s 轮询 /state" as JStore
  component "useLocation\n浏览器 Geolocation；六类手动阶段降级入口" as ULoc
  component "展示与交互组件\nStatusBar · FreshnessBar · MetricsRow · Timeline\nActionCardList · NavigateButton · StageConfirm · ToastHost" as WComp
  component "api/journey.ts（axios + EventSource，baseURL /api/v1）\ncreateJourney / getState / updateLocation / createStream" as ApiTs
}

' ===== ② 接口层 =====
package "② 接口层（Gin HTTP，统一前缀 /api/v1）" as L2 {
  component "api.JourneyHandler\n+ Create(c) · UpdateLocation(c) · State(c) · Stream(c)" as Handler
  component "api.RegisterRoutes\nPOST /journey · POST /journey/{id}/location\nGET /journey/{id}/state · GET /journey/{id}/stream" as Routes
  component "SSE 协议适配\nretry: 5000 · event: snapshot / heartbeat(15s)\nCache-Control: no-cache · X-Accel-Buffering: no" as SSEProto
  note right of Handler
    400 参数错误 / 404 行程不存在 / 500 未预期错误；
    分析失败不返回 5xx，而是产出 status=failed 的快照
  end note
}

' ===== ③ 运行时编排层 =====
package "③ 运行时编排层（单个 Go 进程，进程内编排）" as L3 {
  component "runtime.Runtime\n- store / data / advice / hub / busy: sync.Map\n+ CreateJourney · ApplyLocation · Recalculate\n+ GetSnapshot · Subscribe · StartPeriodicRefresh\n- decide · finish · publishProcessing · analyzeAsync · previousSnapshot" as Rt
  component "编排与并发策略\nbusy.LoadOrStore 去重：同行程并发重算直接返回当前快照，不排队\n单次分析超时 180s；StartPeriodicRefresh 15s 轮询\n每行程刷新间隔不小于 2min；已起飞/取消或出发日期已过则跳过" as RtPolicy
  note right of RtPolicy
    位置或阶段更新后立即重算并经 SSEHub 推送，
    不等周期刷新；finish 先 SaveSnapshot 再 Publish
  end note
}

' ===== ④ Agent 与技能层 =====
package "④ Agent 与技能层（与 Runtime 同一 Go 进程）" as L4 {
  component "data.Agent\n+ BuildState(ctx, Input{Journey, Progress}) → Result{State, Journey, Issues}\n缺失字段 → Registry.Query → applyObservations（类型/枚举/RFC3339 校验）\n→ assessQuality → complete / degraded / unknown" as DataAgent
  component "advice.Agent\n+ Evaluate(ctx, Input{State, Progress, Issues, AirportIATA, HasBaggage}) → Advice\n- evaluate · - degraded · enforceRiskFloor 风险下限" as AdviceAgent
  component "skill.Registry\n+ Register(s) · + Query(ctx, query)\n一个技能支持多字段只调用一次；无技能支持则记 issue" as Registry
  component "skill.Skill（接口）\n+ Name() · + Supports(field) · + Execute(ctx, query)" as SkillIface
  component "FlightIdentitySkill\nEOOB 航班号搜索 JSON（5min 缓存）\n补全缺失的日期与航线" as SkIdentity
  component "FlightStatusSkill\nEOOB 航班状态 JSON\n航班状态 / 时间轴 / 登机口" as SkStatus
  component "AirportStatusSkill\nEOOB 机场页 HTML 与 /api/delaybox/{IATA}\nUA 与 Sec-CH-UA 版本同源；20s 超时" as SkAirport
  component "RouteETASkill\nHaversine 直线距离 ×1.3 ÷ 30km/h\n本地估算，confidence=low，traffic 保持 null" as SkEta
  component "model.Client（接口）\n+ Chat(ctx, req) (Response, error)" as ModelClient
  component "model.OpenAI\nOpenAI 兼容端点（百炼 / vLLM / Ollama）" as ModelOpenAI
  note bottom of DataAgent
    没有观测值的字段一律 null，不用默认值填充；
    单个 Skill 失败只追加 issue，不伪造观测值
  end note
  note bottom of AdviceAgent
    模型未配置 / 调用失败 / 枚举非法 → degraded（risk=unknown）；
    关键数据缺失 → risk=unknown 并过滤带 Nav 的行动；
    不执行改签、支付、叫车
  end note
}

' ===== ⑤ 存储与推送层 =====
package "⑤ 存储与推送层（进程内，无数据库）" as L5 {
  component "store.MemoryStore\n- mu: sync.RWMutex · journeys · snapshots · progress\n+ SaveJourney / GetJourney · SaveSnapshot / GetSnapshot\n+ SaveProgress / GetProgress · ListJourneyIDs" as Ms
  component "runtime.SSEHub\n- mu · subs: map[journeyId]map[chan]struct\n+ Subscribe(id) → (channel, cancel) · + Publish(id, snapshot)\n缓冲深度 4；慢订阅者丢弃该帧" as Hub
  note right of Ms
    进程重启数据即丢失，不支持多实例；
    快照是 REST /state 与 SSE 的唯一数据源
  end note
}

' ===== ⑥ 外部能力 =====
package "⑥ 外部能力（进程外；v1 航班与机场数据只来自 EOOB）" as L6 {
  component "EOOB 聚合站点\napil.eoob.com：航班号搜索 JSON、航班状态 JSON\nwww.eoob.com.cn：机场页 HTML、/api/delaybox/{IATA}" as EOOB
  component "模型服务\nOpenAI 兼容 API；未配置时整条链路仍可运行" as LLM
  component "高德 App / 网页\namapuri://route/plan 与 uri.amap.com\n仅用户点击后打开，不采集轨迹" as Amap
  component "mockserver（开发期夹具，:8081）\n正常 / MU9999 延误+登机口变更 / FAIL 分析失败" as Mock
}

' ===== 布局约束：强制六层纵向堆叠 =====
L1 -[hidden]down- L2
L2 -[hidden]down- L3
L3 -[hidden]down- L4
L4 -[hidden]down- L5
L5 -[hidden]down- L6

' ===== 关系 =====
Dashboard --> ApiTs : submit / retry
JStore --> ApiTs : getState / createStream
ULoc --> ApiTs : updateLocation(lat,lng) 或 (stage)
WComp --> JStore : 只渲染 snapshot，不做业务计算
WComp --> Amap : NavigateButton.open\nApp 优先，1.2s 回退 Web
ApiTs --> Handler : HTTP JSON（POST /journey、POST /location、GET /state）
ApiTs --> SSEProto : EventSource 订阅 /stream
SSEProto --> Handler
Routes --> Handler
Handler --> Rt : 调用 Runtime，不含 Agent 规则
Rt --> DataAgent : BuildState(ctx, Input)\nRt --> AdviceAgent : decide() 后 Evaluate(ctx, Input)\n状态无实质变化时复用上一版建议
Rt --> Ms : Save / Get Journey · Progress · Snapshot
Rt --> Hub : Publish(id, snapshot)
Hub --> Handler : snapshot channel → event: snapshot
DataAgent --> Registry : Query(ctx, query)
Registry --> SkillIface : Execute(ctx, query)
SkillIface <|.. SkIdentity
SkillIface <|.. SkStatus
SkillIface <|.. SkAirport
SkillIface <|.. SkEta
SkIdentity --> EOOB : HTTPS JSON
SkStatus --> EOOB : HTTPS JSON
SkAirport --> EOOB : HTTPS HTML / JSON
AdviceAgent --> ModelClient : Chat(ctx, req)
ModelOpenAI ..|> ModelClient
ModelClient --> LLM : HTTPS
SkEta ..> ULoc : 使用前端上报的坐标\n（经 Handler → Runtime → DataAgent 传入）
Mock .up.> Handler : 开发联调时替代真实后端

@enduml
